{"4355810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shatterlight", "steam_appid": 4355810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHATTERLIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shatterlight</strong> is a survival horror platformer where fears take physical form.<br>A story about light that protects — and darkness that devours everything alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/8626f8f1ad54101a8071c3366bf0d009.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e6fe7fd8ca6417629d7e7eac64920ff2.poster.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e6fe7fd8ca6417629d7e7eac64920ff2.webm?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e6fe7fd8ca6417629d7e7eac64920ff2.mp4?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agnes arrives at an old Victorian mansion with her parents and her younger brother, Edmond.<br>Soon, Edmond discovers that another family once lived in this house — and vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He begins investigating the disappearance of the former owners… and suddenly disappears himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Searching for her brother, Agnes climbs into the attic and passes through a mirror, entering the <strong>Dark World</strong> — a distorted reflection of the mansion, filled with fear, madness, and living darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/7c25f3cab469cd55bd44de20ba4223e6.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/50bf73f90ed669bbd03a5450f5b1f447.poster.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/50bf73f90ed669bbd03a5450f5b1f447.webm?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/50bf73f90ed669bbd03a5450f5b1f447.mp4?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing protecting Agnes in the Dark World is a shard of a mirror.<br>In this world, mirrors are forbidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They were destroyed and shattered because reflected light can resist the darkness.<br>The shard Agnes carries is one of the few that survived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With it, she can reflect light and direct it into the shadows — burning monsters away and opening a path forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/1d31c1920a75997cf0a9afa6ab9786e1.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e5e1bf108e0d63d10b62d2b46fce532e.poster.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e5e1bf108e0d63d10b62d2b46fce532e.webm?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e5e1bf108e0d63d10b62d2b46fce532e.mp4?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agnes is accompanied on her journey by <strong>Shade</strong> — a cunning, sarcastic, and cowardly opossum.<br>Once a household pet, he was transformed into a living shadow in the Dark World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shade is a 2D character existing as a shadow within a 3D world.<br>He often gets into trouble, sometimes lets Agnes down, but still tries to help — in his own way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/7c5fff82973d849bb08b6301b0df7301.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/658e42e687cf3e0bf681c0a15b4cfaec.poster.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/658e42e687cf3e0bf681c0a15b4cfaec.webm?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/658e42e687cf3e0bf681c0a15b4cfaec.mp4?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vanished family did not die.<br>They became adepts of the darkness, losing their sanity and their human forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level of the game represents the personal nightmare of one family member:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arachnophobia and twisted insects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deranged dolls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A greenhouse filled with aggressive plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hospital soaked in fear of pain and helplessness</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the finale, Agnes descends into the basement, where the madness of the house’s owner, <strong>Thorne</strong>, takes on its most horrifying form.<br>Here lies his machine — an attempt to achieve immortality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/52031e420d03adcf8837d26a1ee28f53.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/d087ef887f816ca28aa85a95065b47d9.poster.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/d087ef887f816ca28aa85a95065b47d9.webm?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/d087ef887f816ca28aa85a95065b47d9.mp4?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of the entire missing family, only <strong>Ben</strong> remained sane.<br>A young inventor, he uncovered the true nature of the darkness and learned how to fight it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ben creates weapons, tools, and mechanisms that allow survival in the Dark World.<br>Through him, Agnes gains access to different weapons, puzzles, and new ways to interact with light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darkness is a living substance.<br>It senses, hunts, and kills.<br>Only the mirror — and Ben’s inventions — offer a chance to stand against it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e0401e6116a86c95fdb17b649090cfc0.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=140 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror focused on atmosphere and tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming, stealth, and chase sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat based on manipulating light</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights and unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling and notes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where every fear has a form</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHATTERLIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shatterlight</strong> is a survival horror platformer where fears take physical form.<br>A story about light that protects — and darkness that devours everything alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/8626f8f1ad54101a8071c3366bf0d009.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e6fe7fd8ca6417629d7e7eac64920ff2.poster.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e6fe7fd8ca6417629d7e7eac64920ff2.webm?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e6fe7fd8ca6417629d7e7eac64920ff2.mp4?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agnes arrives at an old Victorian mansion with her parents and her younger brother, Edmond.<br>Soon, Edmond discovers that another family once lived in this house — and vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He begins investigating the disappearance of the former owners… and suddenly disappears himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Searching for her brother, Agnes climbs into the attic and passes through a mirror, entering the <strong>Dark World</strong> — a distorted reflection of the mansion, filled with fear, madness, and living darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/7c25f3cab469cd55bd44de20ba4223e6.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/50bf73f90ed669bbd03a5450f5b1f447.poster.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/50bf73f90ed669bbd03a5450f5b1f447.webm?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/50bf73f90ed669bbd03a5450f5b1f447.mp4?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing protecting Agnes in the Dark World is a shard of a mirror.<br>In this world, mirrors are forbidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They were destroyed and shattered because reflected light can resist the darkness.<br>The shard Agnes carries is one of the few that survived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With it, she can reflect light and direct it into the shadows — burning monsters away and opening a path forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/1d31c1920a75997cf0a9afa6ab9786e1.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e5e1bf108e0d63d10b62d2b46fce532e.poster.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e5e1bf108e0d63d10b62d2b46fce532e.webm?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e5e1bf108e0d63d10b62d2b46fce532e.mp4?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agnes is accompanied on her journey by <strong>Shade</strong> — a cunning, sarcastic, and cowardly opossum.<br>Once a household pet, he was transformed into a living shadow in the Dark World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shade is a 2D character existing as a shadow within a 3D world.<br>He often gets into trouble, sometimes lets Agnes down, but still tries to help — in his own way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/7c5fff82973d849bb08b6301b0df7301.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/658e42e687cf3e0bf681c0a15b4cfaec.poster.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/658e42e687cf3e0bf681c0a15b4cfaec.webm?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/658e42e687cf3e0bf681c0a15b4cfaec.mp4?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vanished family did not die.<br>They became adepts of the darkness, losing their sanity and their human forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level of the game represents the personal nightmare of one family member:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arachnophobia and twisted insects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deranged dolls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A greenhouse filled with aggressive plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hospital soaked in fear of pain and helplessness</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the finale, Agnes descends into the basement, where the madness of the house’s owner, <strong>Thorne</strong>, takes on its most horrifying form.<br>Here lies his machine — an attempt to achieve immortality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/52031e420d03adcf8837d26a1ee28f53.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/d087ef887f816ca28aa85a95065b47d9.poster.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/d087ef887f816ca28aa85a95065b47d9.webm?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/d087ef887f816ca28aa85a95065b47d9.mp4?t=1778602856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of the entire missing family, only <strong>Ben</strong> remained sane.<br>A young inventor, he uncovered the true nature of the darkness and learned how to fight it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ben creates weapons, tools, and mechanisms that allow survival in the Dark World.<br>Through him, Agnes gains access to different weapons, puzzles, and new ways to interact with light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darkness is a living substance.<br>It senses, hunts, and kills.<br>Only the mirror — and Ben’s inventions — offer a chance to stand against it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/extras/e0401e6116a86c95fdb17b649090cfc0.avif?t=1778602856\" width=720 height=140 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror focused on atmosphere and tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming, stealth, and chase sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat based on manipulating light</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights and unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling and notes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where every fear has a form</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Shatterlight — survival horror platformer. Play as Agnes as you enter a Victorian mansion swallowed by the Dark World, where fears take physical form. Use light and a mirror shard to survive living darkness, uncover a family’s nightmare, and find your missing brother.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/648d5b297637da4b540fe0669c29955f78be7bf1/header.jpg?t=1778602856", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/dfd14dc6320041de0c881a631df99ec00ea79e88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778602856", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4355810/dfd14dc6320041de0c881a631df99ec00ea79e88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778602856", "website": "https://theshatterlight.com/index-en", "pc_requiremen